    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        What About the Scene with the Hitler Reference? HAUNT: A Framework to Probe <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLMs</span>&#39; Self-consistency Via Adversarial Nudge
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Dutta%2C+A">Arka Dutta</a>, 
      
