        Towards Understanding Self-play for <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> Reasoning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chae%2C+J+Y">Justin Yang Chae</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Alam%2C+M+T">Md Tanvirul Alam</a>, 
      
