    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        MM-OPERA: Benchmarking Open-ended Association Reasoning for Large Vision-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Huang%2C+Z">Zimeng Huang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ke%2C+J">Jinxin Ke</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fan%2C+X">Xiaoxuan Fan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yang%2C+Y">Yufeng Yang</a>, 
      
